This plugin includes material adapted from the On-Call Kit
(https://github.com/anthropics/oncall-kit), Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Adapted files keep their original copyright and SPDX headers and carry a
"Modified for Kopai" note describing what changed. The adaptations:

- skills/kopai-oncall-setup   from skills/oncall-setup, plus templates/,
                              eval/replay.md, ONBOARD.md and TAG-SETUP.md
- skills/kopai-triage         from skills/triage (failure-class references
                              rewritten for service telemetry in Kopai)
- skills/kopai-handoff        from skills/handoff
- skills/kopai-weather        from skills/weather
- skills/kopai-oncall-setup/templates/ONCALL-RULES.md
                              from the standing rules in CLAUDE.md
- skills/kopai-verify-fix     new; expands step 9 of skills/triage
- skills/kopai-triage/references/
                              new content for Kopai, in the structure of
                              the kit's triage references

Main changes: skills are renamed with a kopai- prefix; telemetry
capabilities (metrics, logs, traces) bind to the Kopai MCP connector;
team-specific playbooks live in the team's own repository instead of the
plugin; and the standing rules ship as ONCALL-RULES.md, which setup copies
into the team's repository.

The skills root-cause-analysis, create-live-page, otel-instrumentation and
create-dashboard are Kopai's own and are copied from the repository's
top-level skills/ directory by scripts/sync-plugin-skills.mjs.
